<title>UK: Celltech drops 53 pct to 295p on drug news.</title>
<headline>Celltech drops 53 pct to 295p on drug news.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in British biotechnology firm Celltech Group Plc more than halved on news its antibody CDP 571 will not be developed further in septic shock treatment following trial results from Germany's Bayer AG.</p>
<p>At 0717 GMT, shares in Celltech had slumped by around 53 percent to 295 pence from Tuesday's close of 630 pence.</p>
</text>
